{% comment %}
  Animated SVG thumbnail for post lists (front matter: thumbnail_anim). An <iframe>, not <img>: Safari only
  partly repaints CSS animations inside an SVG shown via <img> when it is scaled down, and the site's CSP
  blocks <object>. The SVG fits itself into the box like `object-fit: contain`.
{% endcomment %}
<iframe
  class="anim-thumb"
  src="{{ include.src | relative_url }}"
  title="{{ include.title | strip_html | escape }}"
  aria-hidden="true"
  tabindex="-1"
  loading="lazy"
  scrolling="no"
></iframe>
